<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6445] IgniteTxManager.txLocksInfo method misses locks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6445</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In some cases &quot;IgniteTxManager.txLocksInfo&quot; method (searches for locks) misses locks.&lt;br/&gt;
For example:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;In case of a configuration with near cache, entries are created for the near cache and for the ordinal cache. For each entry, their own MVCC candidates are created.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;For non-custom objects of type (Integer, etc.), the entry stored in &quot;GridNearTxLocal&quot; is not associated with MVCC candidates with which the same entity is associated in another format stored in &quot;GridDhtTxLocal&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13103280">IGNITE-6445</key>
            <summary>IgniteTxManager.txLocksInfo method misses locks</summary>
