&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6445&quot; title=&quot;IgniteTxManager.txLocksInfo method misses locks&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6445&quot;&gt;IGNITE-6445&lt;/a&gt;: Bug fixed.&lt;/p&gt;

