                            <comment id="16251616" author="vitaliyb" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 16:09:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
My first solution was bad. &lt;br/&gt;
It is enough to fix method &lt;tt&gt;GridNearOptimisticTxPrepareFuture#requestedKeys&lt;/tt&gt;. It can return keys requested from the local node,  and if &lt;tt&gt;GridNearTxLocal&lt;/tt&gt; is process first, then locks from &lt;tt&gt;GridDhtTxLocal&lt;/tt&gt; can be lost.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please take a look at my new solution.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actual PR, TC run, and Upsourse review are in &lt;b&gt;Issue Links&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17271457" author="mmuzaf" created="Mon, 25 Jan 2021 16:30:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue has moved to the next release. Please, let me know if we still should include it to the 2.10&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
